# class: stair-safety
# origin: issue #364 (the landing zone at a flight's foot); Approved Document K (2013) 1.21b keeps a landing clear of permanent obstructions
# expect: W_FURNITURE_ON_STAIR
# status: done
# fact: the flight's foot is its south end at y 3500; the 1000 mm landing beyond it is x 1000-2000, y 3500-4500, and the
#   bookcase stands at x 1200-2200, y 3700-4000 on it
plan "Bookcase on the landing" {
  units mm
  room id=hall at (0,0) size 6000x5000 label "Hall" uses hall
  walls from rooms exterior 200 partition 100
  door on hall.bottom at 4500 from start width 1000 swing into hall
  window on hall.top at 4500 from start width 1500
  stair id=s1 at (1000,500) size 1000x3000 dir up
  furniture bookcase at (1200,3700) size 1000x300
}
